+        """Whether a foreground request waits in the queue. ``Waiting.foreground`` counts every entry not marked
+        background, so a shutdown flush's wake-up item (``_Flush``, the class itself) counted too and made a
+        background stream give its lane up -- its decode thrown away and replayed -- with nobody waiting for the lane
+        (the flush runs at the top of the next ``_admit`` whatever the lanes hold)."""
